	(text "ASSEMBLY / SUPPLY NOTES\nVIN: 3.3 V nominal. JP1: bridge 1-2 for VIN logic, or 2-3 for 1.8 V logic; never bridge both.\nHost SPI/reset/motion levels must match selected VDDIO. No level shifting is provided.\nR4 and C7 are DNP with TLV74318 (pin 4 NC). Fit only for a compatible alternate regulator after checking its pinout.\nPlace bypass capacitors close to their respective sensor/regulator pins."
